<title>FRANCE: Rouen April 1-16 grain exports 204,697 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen April 1-16 grain exports 204,697 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain exports from Rouen reached 204,697 tonnes between April 1 and April 16, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Grain exports totalled 373,000 tonnes for the whole of April 1996.</p>
<p>The 204,697 tonnes total included 200,892 tonnes of wheat, 2,200 tonnes of barley and 1,605 tonnes of maize.</p>
<p>Officials gave the following breakdown by destination (in tonnes):</p>
<p>WHEAT</p>
<p>    West Africa		   36,200</p>
<p>    Canary Islands		14,700</p>
<p>    Britain			  9,517</p>
<p>    Italy			  140,475</p>
<p>BARLEY</p>
<p>    Tunisia			  2,200</p>
<p>MAIZE</p>
<p>    Britain			  1,605</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
